WEBVTT

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:11.070
Wh-What the heck is this?!

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:15.370
Tsubame, I'm a huge fan!

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:17.040
Hey! Thanks for your support.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.080
I'm rooting for you!

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:24.980
Whoa... Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:27.990
Asakusa?!

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.340
I found a robot!

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:32.340
A robot?!

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:35.910
It was under a sheet, but the 
shape was a giant robot.

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:39.010
I could tell where the head and shoulders were!

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:42.130
Something is definitely going on in this school!

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:44.210
Let's go! I wanna see it, too!

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:55.650
Mizusaki, it's a bad idea to just waltz in.

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:57.870
I don't see anything.

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:00.060
Huh... It's gone.

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:08.380
<b>Iron Giant Left Side</b>

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:08.800
"Iron Giant—"

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:11.260
There's a bunch of robot books over here!

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.760
<b>Science</b>

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.760
<b>Shibahama Industrial</b>

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.760
<b>Introduction to Robotics</b>

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.760
<b>Constructing Heavy Machinery</b>

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:12.770
Wait.

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:15.910
Look at the floor. These are robot footprints!

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:19.140
Who are you two?!

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:21.470
Out the window we go!

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:35.490
Mizusaki's down...

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:38.360
Mysterious pursuers, a missing robot...

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:39.990
And Mizusaki, who has been captured!

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:42.940
I had thought this was going 
to be giant robot sci-fi,

00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:47.050
but now it's got the scent 
of robot crime instead.

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:52.500
The left side of the iron giant... 
It's bigger than I thought!

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:54.670
It really is giant robot sci-fi!

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:56.670
<b>Lost Shibahama Civilization</b>

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:57.050
