00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:02.410
m 394 172 l 394 219 520 221 519 174

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:02.410
<b>Joints with exposed open 
spaces on both sides make 
it seem vaguely biological.</b>

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:04.070
Do those mysterious footprints point 
to the existence of a giant robot?!

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:02.410
<b>Hydraulics</b>

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:02.410
<b>Hold the drawstring</b>

